  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Sustainable Energy in the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU will support the Philippines in achieving inclusive economic growth through greater access to sustainable energy for the poor in rural, remote and underdeveloped areas. More investments in renewable energy will be promoted while the power system of the Philippines will become more resilient to natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
